[I] Library handling the communication with Apple's Tatsu Signing Server (TSS)

[T] This library is part of the libimobiledevice project. The main purpose of
[T] this library is to allow creating TSS request payloads, sending them to
[T] Apple's TSS server, and retrieving and processing the response.

